  "execution_requirements": "Each phase still requires its own exact Root configuration. BuildQuery requires the complete granted batch, separate catalog source acceptance, fresh private caches, serial fresh16GiB admission, retained/live bounded process owners, complete whole source/vendor/compiler/control seals and independent metadata/artifact/current-input/process closure. Only actual complete positive BuildQuery acceptance can support a separate strict RuntimeOnly grant. Positive runtime requires the complete original durable job observation, exact actual owner/wire evidence, empty stderr and every accepted index completing with zero flags.",
